好，那 Minimum Stall Speed 呢，是你們都知道 Rotation speed

13
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:21,000
那 V1 呢，是 Takeoff action speed during the takeoff, when the pilot must take the first action to stop

14
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:28,000
while within the accelerate-stop distance, such as applying brakes or reducing the thrust.

15
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Also the minimum speed, uh, following an failure of a critical engine at the VEF

16
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:41,000
at which the pilot can continue the takeoff and achieve the required height above the takeoff surface

17
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,000
within the takeoff distance. 好

18
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:55,000
那 V2 是 Takeoff Safety Speed

19
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:01,000
啊，那 frequently a speed that allow for the optimum... uh...

20
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:05,000
V2 min 是 Minimum takeoff safety speed, V2 min

21
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:11,000
好，那 Vs0 是 Stall speed or minimum steady flight speed in the landing configuration

22
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:19,000
Vs1 是 for, uh, the stall speed, obtained in a specified configuration

23
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:26,000
所以是，你可以有 Flap 1 的 Vs1，你也可以有 Flap Up 的那個什麼 Vs1

24
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:30,000
對，OK 嗎？好

25
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:39,000
