28
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:58,000
Maximum bank angle allowed 是多少？5 度。最大的 bank angle

29
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:08,000
然後，但是，然後再來就是 maintain directional control, heading change 不可以超過幾度？20 度

30
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:13,000
好。好

31
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Vxse 是 Best Angle of Climb OEI, Vyse 是 Best Rate of Climb OEI, 那 Vref 是 Reference Speed for landing

32
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:32,000
at the speed of a final approach, which is adjust to the normal approach speed factor. 好，那 Vsse... (不確定內容)

